  <!-- ─── Engine feedback ────────────────────────────────────────────
       UserFeedback Title/Body pairs raised by TranscriptionEngine when an
       error or warning is worth surfacing in the HUD. Each pair maps
       to one (Severity, Role) combination decided in code, not here.
       Naming: Engine_<Reason>_Title and Engine_<Reason>_Body. -->

  <!-- ─── Microphone errors ──────────────────────────────────────────
       UserFeedback pairs raised by TranscriptionEngine.LocalizeMicError when
       MicrophoneCapture.Probe / Record returns a MicErrorKind. The
       Unavailable body interpolates the raw MMSYSERR code as {0}
       for diagnostic clarity. -->

